desc: Home Truths Monosynth (Mutable Instruments Shruthi-1 port) by chmaha
tags: instrument synthesizer monosynth 8-bit sequencer arpeggiator
author: chmaha
version: 1.0
changelog:
  Initial preview.
about:
  A Mutable Instruments Shruthi-1 with its digital DSP filter board: the 8-bit hybrid monosynth's firmware voice
  (two oscillators with 35 shapes from classic waves to CZ, FM, wavetables, vowels and noise, 14 operators,
  sub oscillator and transients, two envelopes, two LFOs, a 12-slot modulation matrix with two CV operators,
  step sequencer and arpeggiator) and the DSP board's 3-pole low/high-pass filter, VCA and 16 effects
  (distortion, bit crusher, comb filters, ring mod, delays, tempo delays, looper, pitch shifter).
  Runs at the original 39.2 kHz with the original integer maths, checked sample-exact against both firmwares.
  MIDI: notes, velocity, mod wheel, aftertouch, pitch bend, hold pedal, the Shruthi's CC map and NRPN, program change
  (factory patches 1-128). Tempo "Host" follows the REAPER transport.
  Needs Dependencies/HomeTruths/home_truths_tables.txt and home_truths_presets.txt.
  Ported from the Shruthi-1 firmware 1.03 and DSP filter board firmware by Emilie Gillet (Mutable Instruments,
  https://github.com/pichenettes/shruthi-1, GPLv3+), with the factory patches and sequences.
  JSFX version released under GPLv3+ license
  Claude generated some of this code
provides:
  Dependencies/HomeTruths/home_truths_tables.txt
  Dependencies/HomeTruths/home_truths_presets.txt

